{"id":"quway2g1dm399ii7z05z57dcr","title":"CoreWeave强劲季报难改伯恩斯坦汇丰'卖出'评级","originalTitle":"CoreWeave季报史上最强，但伯恩斯坦和汇丰仍坚持\"卖出\"","summary":"CoreWeave三季度营收36.6亿美元超预期，利润率及订单量双升，管理层称融资缺口已解决，但伯恩斯坦和汇丰维持卖出评级。核心质疑：1）定价合理性（每兆瓦年价2000-2500万美元，历史均值约1200万美元）；2）融资缺口（伯恩斯坦测算325亿，汇丰330亿）；3）供给过剩风险（2028年前市场将新增55GW算力，相当于20个CoreWeave规模）。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"华尔街见闻"},"links":{"original":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785788"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T06:02:40.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T06:10:04.770Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T06:10:04.770Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["财报","监管处罚","半导体"],"score":77,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"semiconductor","name":"半导体"},{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"},{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}